    {
      "block_id": "page-0793-block-0003",
      "order": 3,
      "text": "Cholinesterase Inhibitors\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88978576660156,
        110.55787658691406,
        149.3997802734375,
        119.44537353515625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "a2f5a5d25715e1fa46a6953d2fd61b0c79cc83aa0bde59cfd449b2aa599f94f0"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0793-block-0004",
      "order": 4,
      "text": "Donepezil75\nOral 5mg od\nReasonably well \ntolerated compared \nwith placebo. Nausea, \nvomiting and \ndiarrhoea are the most \ncommon adverse \neffects reported\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.88978576660156,
        130.86036682128906,
        298.07696533203125,
        199.55535888671875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "354e861cf289d2bf54edc1b9ec72fe722dbabbd025ab2f51d45f9f8e6e7078b1"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0793-block-0005",
      "order": 5,
      "text": "Very limited evidence. In the small \nstudies where it has been used, clinical \nbenefits have not been convincing. \nNot recommended\n",
      "bbox": [
        307.9994812011719,
        130.8478546142578,
        433.7220764160156,
        169.5478515625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "353a9e2f3a1a1b649d3348d3ca662caf464a7600e6f29b7dc3fd1aadcb767aaf"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0793-block-0006",
      "order": 6,
      "text": "Rivastigmine76–78\nOral 1.5–6mg \nbd\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.886993408203125,
        208.9678497314453,
        206.1494903564453,
        227.69290161132812
      ],
      "text_sha256": "1970057d515b3e4522591bd8f2fc781a63c2e52d11a48f7aab85b5097b5cddb1"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0793-block-0007",
      "order": 7,
      "text": "A study which added \nrivastigmine to usual \ncare (haloperidol), \nshowed that \nrivastigmine did not \ndecrease the duration \nof delirium but in fact \nwas associated with a \nmore severe type of \ndelirium, a longer stay \nin intensive care and \nhigher mortality \ncompared with placebo\n",
      "bbox": [
        223.38449096679688,
        208.98789978027344,
        295.6770324707031,
        337.6653747558594
      ],
      "text_sha256": "47b2e4a3af1e61fc4fd569b1ed06b633c3b5e2b83021409d5cd1f6bf992a316a"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0793-block-0008",
      "order": 8,
      "text": "Use of rivastigmine to treat delirium in \ncritically ill patients is not \nrecommended. May have a place in \ndelirium prevention34\n",
      "bbox": [
        307.9994812011719,
        208.95787048339844,
        432.4470520019531,
        247.65786743164062
      ],
      "text_sha256": "2b1c50caac752c6a4359c0c6dd528185277baa15511406ac4e886906d1e7344e"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0793-block-0009",
      "order": 9,
      "text": "Other Drugs\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.889801025390625,
        347.0428771972656,
        105.22480010986328,
        355.9303894042969
      ],
      "text_sha256": "8f020a617efd7e582a770b951aa5d395f3de857492449f0572a7269e1ef958a5"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0793-block-0010",
      "order": 10,
      "text": "Trazodone4,7\n25–150mg \nnocte\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.889801025390625,
        367.34539794921875,
        196.99209594726562,
        386.0528869628906
      ],
      "text_sha256": "208208f33ec34ca2d9e2550f1843699ca65454e4ea4b8f6b4fa07a1a5806d5e7"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0793-block-0011",
      "order": 11,
      "text": "Over sedation is \nproblematic\n",
      "bbox": [
        223.3845977783203,
        367.347900390625,
        276.30462646484375,
        386.0528869628906
      ],
      "text_sha256": "b6bcc4c03d08d010e2a258379d11dc281b351bd9a3db06f2cf5702c4dd9e5955"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0793-block-0012",
      "order": 12,
      "text": "Limited experience – used only in \nuncontrolled studies. Not \nrecommended\n",
      "bbox": [
        307.9996032714844,
        367.347900390625,
        415.9246520996094,
        396.0503845214844
      ],
      "text_sha256": "1757238a4f6da40f857cafe62c89eb04f432ac79191565001b9c0cb60b66d317"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0793-block-0013",
      "order": 13,
      "text": "Sodium valproate79–82\nOral/IM/IV\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.887115478515625,
        405.47039794921875,
        191.9670867919922,
        414.1803894042969
      ],
      "text_sha256": "e1bb2b413b5529783e2c7267b19b10665223b1b9b18c52ed1ea813701f1eb80f"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0793-block-0014",
      "order": 14,
      "text": "250mg bd \nincreased to \naround \n1500mg/day, or \n20mg/kg/day\n",
      "bbox": [
        159.8896026611328,
        418.47039794921875,
        212.5546112060547,
        467.1678771972656
      ],
      "text_sha256": "c8bcf78c1756c126cf86bef0a3fc4ae839e879a69aa1f56e54117a486dbfc092"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0793-block-0015",
      "order": 15,
      "text": "Target plasma \nlevels have not \nbeen validated \nfor this \nindication. Note \nthat physically \nill patients may \nhave altered \nalbumin \nbinding of \nvalproate.\n",
      "bbox": [
        159.8896026611328,
        471.4578857421875,
        212.8170928955078,
        580.140380859375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "bf838be47740f5bd719857695f7aa4ddea499eb1e3acb9929b2237919a41cbe5"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0793-block-0016",
      "order": 16,
      "text": "IV loading \ndoses have also \nbeen used in \nICU settings\n",
      "bbox": [
        159.8896026611328,
        584.4302978515625,
        211.5720977783203,
        623.13037109375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "8ae8db9b1da7ec53e5461031733b0c1ebbf1f15e3097a3b1eab3177afc713d30"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0793-block-0017",
      "order": 17,
      "text": "Contraindicated in \nactive liver disease\n",
      "bbox": [
        223.3845977783203,
        405.42034912109375,
        284.64459228515625,
        424.1253356933594
      ],
      "text_sha256": "7ed926315eb3084cc8ba83c50018d042c1d6ea1393e711b131b18c25c13b689b"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0793-block-0018",
      "order": 18,
      "text": "Monitor for \nthrombocytopaenia \n(more common in \ncritically ill patients)\n",
      "bbox": [
        223.3845977783203,
        428.41534423828125,
        287.8396301269531,
        467.1153259277344
      ],
      "text_sha256": "f5bcb850ffec64123d74dba3fa2783649a345b5d31c3525a7da22cb2463f248c"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0793-block-0019",
      "order": 19,
      "text": "Some case reports of use where \nantipsychotics and/or benzodiazepines \nare ineffective; otherwise not \nrecommended\n",
      "bbox": [
        307.9996032714844,
        405.40533447265625,
        432.604736328125,
        444.1053161621094
      ],
      "text_sha256": "e741d843938b21f948d0927fd8b509124a02be4e2ce6c5b2a543f02b210f1bb8"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0793-block-0020",
      "order": 20,
      "text": "bd, bis die (twice a day); nocte, at night; od, omne in die (once a day)\n",
